  "details": "The names and sizes of the avatars are not visible in the map, which has a major drawback, for people who want to find small files of avatars this is very difficult. Some avatar files are very large and showing the file size helps people to identify and filter them.\nIn the case that the Avatar creator does not change the default text, the interactive hint will only show Use, which is not useful. Some maps have so many avatars that some of them have almost identical covers or make it impossible to distinguish what they are.\nSo it is necessary to show Avatar names.\nThe last point is that showing the performance level would also be extra helpful?",
